  "description": "An idiomatic, immutable, fluent C# wrapper over Kookerella.FsOpenXmlDsl - build and read Excel workbooks (.xlsx/.xlsm) from C# without touching F# discriminated unions or option types directly. Covers cell values/formulas, styling, merged ranges/freeze panes/autofilter, Excel Tables, charts, images, pivot tables, VBA (as opaque bytes), and code generation; sparklines, conditional formatting, data validation, and a few other less common F# core features are available by referencing Kookerella.FsOpenXmlDsl directly.",
